$ mem 
pronoun :: 1stSg Nominative :: I

- memen :: 1stPlural Nominative ::  we

- possessor suffixes :: -em, -emen

- verbal subject prefixes :: -em, , emen (and -enem, -enemen, if you include the noun's plural marker as old grammars used to do)

- see mot, mûr, mîn, mast, mom, meg, mej



|------|------------|
| mem  | nominative |
| mot  | accusative |
| mûr  | genitive   |
| mîn  | dative     |
| mast | ablative   |
| mom  | allative   |
| meg  | comitative |
| mej  | caritive   |




